R-CH12 R-CH3 R-OUT1 (slice 242, Design Q612, Q614 item 4): the exit 2 stops of `tln roc channel add`, all before any request (no http file, no list_dirs of the cache). Runs 1 to 3: the name (bad, reserved, starts with a reserved word and -). Run 4: no name (the design example: `give the channel name: tln roc channel add <name> <URL>`). Runs 5 to 7: the URL forms that are not known (another host, http, a page of the repo that is not a form): the design text `known channel sources: github.com/<owner>/<repo>` is the hint line. The first line of runs 1 to 3 and 5 to 7 is a proposal (TW24).
